      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FRENZY (1) hit the ground running from out wide and on speed early but faded and swamped late when 5th at Sandown in Grade 5 company. Better than the latest effort and deserves another chance. SUNNY STRIDE (2) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (22.45) at this track behind Sweet I Am in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Can measure up. NOBLE DASH (8) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (22.38) at this track behind Loves A Chat in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Expecting another good run. BASEMENT (3) has been freshened and can sneak into the frame on his best form.",
